    {
      "id": "txt034",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 864.28,
      "height": 42.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 269246,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3560786,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The green nodes are the ones with an operator in them. There are three, and GIMPLE\nhas three statements. That is the whole rule.",
      "originalText": "The green nodes are the ones with an operator in them. There are three, and GIMPLE\nhas three statements. That is the whole rule.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt035",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 406.71999999999997,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 277165,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3665515,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "in this order, depth first, left to right",
      "originalText": "in this order, depth first, left to right",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt036",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 823.36,
      "height": 200.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 285084,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3770244,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why the order is the order.\n\nA statement can only mention values that already exist, so a node has to be written\nout after both of its children. That is a post-order walk, and it is why the first\nline of GIMPLE corresponds to the deepest leftmost operator in the source rather\nthan to the one you read first.\n\nThe leaves get nothing. a, b and c are already values, and a value needs no\nstatement to compute it. This is the difference the whole representation turns on:\nGIMPLE allows a value anywhere an operand is wanted, and allows nothing else.",
      "originalText": "Why the order is the order.\n\nA statement can only mention values that already exist, so a node has to be written\nout after both of its children. That is a post-order walk, and it is why the first\nline of GIMPLE corresponds to the deepest leftmost operator in the source rather\nthan to the one you read first.\n\nThe leaves get nothing. a, b and c are already values, and a value needs no\nstatement to compute it. This is the difference the whole representation turns on:\nGIMPLE allows a value anywhere an operand is wanted, and allows nothing else.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt037",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 426.56,
      "height": 80.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 293003,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3874973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "D.4635 is the return slot, which the front\nend makes for every function. _1 and _2 are\nthe ones gimplification invented, one per\ninterior node it could not leave nested.",
      "originalText": "D.4635 is the return slot, which the front\nend makes for every function. _1 and _2 are\nthe ones gimplification invented, one per\ninterior node it could not leave nested.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
